var GP_NOTE='Gross profit = net sales − cost of sales. Consensus = Bloomberg’s gross profit on its headline revenue. No Summit line: the model carries no cost of sales. Amazon itself calls operating income “a more meaningful measure than gross profit and gross margin due to the diversity of our product categories and services” (10-K MD&amp;A).';
